# Vendored specs and generated types are written with LF by the sync/generate scripts.
# Without this, a checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF and the
# "generated files are up-to-date" CI job fails on Windows for no real reason.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
